# Declared bootstrap baseline for the Full CI changed-code quality interval.
#
# scripts/quality-interval.mjs prefers, in order: an explicit quality_base_ref
# input, then the newest successful ancestral Full CI run. A trigger that
# cannot carry an input - the monthly schedule - had no third option, so a
# repository with no successful Full CI run on the branch could never start
# one. This file is that explicit initial base: reviewed in-repo, verified to
# be an ancestor of the tested commit, and ignored the moment a successful
# ancestral Full CI run exists on the branch.
#
# Exactly one full lowercase 40-character commit SHA. Move it only forward, to
# a commit whose complete sweep is known good.
